:question
$()Voici une quadrique ($val21) d'équation 
!insmath $val19
$()	<div class="wimscenter"> <img src="$val1/$val18" alt=""></div>	<p>	On la coupe selon le plan 
!insmath $val11=$val14
$(). Parmi les dessins suivants, lequel représente cette coupe ?	</p>	<table class="wimscenter"><tr><td> 
!read oef/draw.phtml 150,150 \
	 xrange -$val34,$val34	 yrange -$val34,$val34	 hline 0,0, black	 vline 0,0,black	 arrow 0,0,0,1, 6,black	 arrow 0,0,1,0, 6,black	 levelcurve red, $val30,0	 text black,0,$val34,medium,$val10	 text black,$val34-0.5,0,medium,$val9	 
$()	</td><td>	 
!read oef/draw.phtml 150,150 \
	 xrange -$val34,$val34	 yrange -$val34,$val34	 arrow 0,0,0,1, 6,black	 arrow 0,0,1,0, 6,black	 hline 0,0, black	 text black,0,$val34,medium,$val10	 text black,$val34-0.5,0,medium,$val9	 vline 0,0,black	 levelcurve red, $val31,0	 
$()	</td><td>	 
!read oef/draw.phtml 150,150 \
	 xrange -$val34,$val34	 yrange -$val34,$val34	 arrow 0,0,0,1, 6,black	 arrow 0,0,1,0, 6,black	 hline 0,0, black	 vline 0,0,black	 text black,0,$val34,medium,$val10	 text black,$val34-0.5,0,medium,$val9	 levelcurve red, $val32,0	 
$()	</td></tr>	<tr><td> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply 1,1 
$()</td><td> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply 1,2 
$()</td><td> 
!read oef/embed.phtml reply 1,3 
$()</td></tr>	 </table>	
$()
